          "code": "QUERY_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1772096562645",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772096562646_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Task:\n - Provided with the user query and the meeting data, Answer the user query in the below format.\n\nReturn the output in Markdown without code fences. Do not include any title for the answer. Provide a clear answer section first, then an insights section.\n\nOutput format:\n- Start with the answer content. Use bold for any key points where needed.\n- Then include a single section heading named “Additional insights”.\n- Under “Additional insights”, provide bullet-point insights.\n\nExample structure:\n**Answer**\n- Your primary answer content here, with any key points in **bold**.\n\nAdditional insights\n- Insight 1\n- Insight 2\n\n- **Note** :  If the user query cannot be answered with the available data, return only \"Data not available to answer the query\".\n- Do not invent answers. The answer should be based on the provided data. It is the source of truth.\n\nData source:\n {{$context.$variables.meetingDetails}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "errorNodeId": "1771994591966",
