          "code": "COMMUNICATION_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1771955892879",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771955892881_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Given this input: {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_TOP_2_APPOINTMENTS.$output.result}}\n\nTask:\n- For each of the appointment as input return the communication in the below format.\n\n   \"title\": \"Agenda for activity.Subject\", #Dynamically fill the meeting context from the data.\n  \"shortDescription\": one sentence summarizing the email’s intent,\n  \"actionText\": \"Send email\",\n  \"type\": \"email\",\n   targetAgent: ‘MEETING_OVERVIEW’\n\"content\": - emailBodyHtml (full HTML) Fill in as per the instruction given below.\n  - emailBodyHtml (full HTML)\n - To Address: mail id all the contacts from ListOfContacts. Return null if this attribute is not available.\n- Cc Address: Mail id all the resources from attribute ListOfResourcesForTheTeam. Return null if this attribute is not available.\n\n\n\nin the emailBodyHtml include\n - Greeting: “Hello {{RecipientName}},”\n - 1  sentence context referencing the opportunity name.\n- Date and Time of the appointment.\n  - An action-oriented intro: “Setting the agenda for the meeting”\n  - Bullet list (4 ~ 5 items) that sets the agenda based on the meeting_context, executive_context of the meeting.\n  - Signature: “Best regards, <SenderName>.  for Sender name use the Full name from {{$context.$app.$OraUserContext}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "format response",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let res = $context.$nodes.CALLING_ASSISTANT_FOR_THE_TALKING_POINTS.$output.output??{};\nlet success = $context.$nodes.REFINE_TOP_2_APPOINTMENTS.$status;\ntry{ res = JSON.parse(res); } catch { success = \"ERROR\" }\nconst result = {\"postback\":res?.postback??\"\",\"success\":success};\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1771993975123"
          },
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5225,
